*****************************************************************
Welcome to the Docker container of the dumux module "rotating-cylinders"!

You can compile and execute the examples from within the build tree of the
module at /dumux/rotating-cylinders/build-cmake.

To run the simulation follow the steps below
"
cd /dumux/rotating-cylinders/build-cmake/test/freeflow/navierstokes/rotatingcylinders \
make test_ff_navierstokes_rotatingcylinders \
./test_ff_navierstokes_rotatingcylinders

"

Note that the container does not have graphics support, but copying the output
(e.g. VTK files) to the folder /dumux/shared will make them available outside
this container on the host for display.